module gunbc.host_layout


data host_layout_note: String = "The ONE authority for the srv1 gunbc host paths (docs/plans/gunbc-served-dashboard-design.md section 5; lane agreement with royal-carp-451, 2026-07-20). Three facts, each with two consumers that MUST agree or in-process dispatch breaks: srv1_gunbc_repo_root is BOTH the tree `gunbc serve` loads AND the repo the belt runs `git worktree add` from (the same fact — which is precisely why dispatch works in-process); srv1_dispatch_worktree_root is where those worktrees land (belt spawn target AND deploy-provisioned directory); srv1_gunbc_serve_binary is the deployed seed binary the systemd unit execs. gunbc.roadmap_belt_actuate.belt_actuate_workdir and gunbc.roadmap_dispatch_actuator.dispatch_worktree_root are PROJECTIONS of these rows (their private copies deleted — DESIGN 3, single authority), and gunbc.live_deploy.spec consumes the same rows so the paths exist on the host BECAUSE the deploy's own membership says so. Interim: the parent lane hand-provisions srv1 to these exact paths (no env-var fork); that hand-provisioning dissolves when the live_deploy membership formalizes it."

data srv1_gunbc_repo_root: FilePath = "/opt/gunbc/gunbc" as FilePath

data srv1_gunbc_serve_binary: FilePath = "/opt/gunbc/bin/gunbc" as FilePath

data srv1_dispatch_worktree_root: FilePath = "/opt/gunbc/dispatch-worktrees" as FilePath
